(text "REV B: R8 16k / D10 and R9 32k / D3 are DNP.\nPR259 remains 6-bit. 8-bit: D9..D4 = bits 7..2, D10 = bit 1, D3 = bit 0.\nPopulate only with wider DAC firmware and loaded CVBS / D3 boot validation." (at 144.78 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid c4b4dd71-bbc3-4119-b1ae-22e2f3fb9e01))(text "SJ2 / SJ3: rear, normally OPEN.\n6-bit: both open. 7-bit: close SJ2 only.\n8-bit: close SJ2 + SJ3.\nFit R8/R9 and use matching DAC firmware." (at 144.78 76.2 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid c5f1d9d4-6770-46b5-a39a-2bfcfd960c9b))
